{"version":1,"content":"<p>亞姐冠軍邱月清，曾於90年代露點拍攝三級片《三度誘惑》，是首位演出三級片的亞洲小姐，淡出後神隱多年。</p><p>現年61歲的她罕有露面，年前被圈中舊友捕獲，雖然性感不再，但仍皮光肉滑保養得宜，氣質不減當年。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;邱</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T04:21:26.205047+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T04:01:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T04:18:10.521523+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T04:18:10.521523+00:00","content_hash":"fc163d3c16254f3fb7a100a86b9b7c1aaa72f85d26d8146c491f36b94b31ab9e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}